{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Evolvania</i>\u00a0you embody a mysterious, wandering eye on a quest to seize  eyedrops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deep into a colossal creature and discover the mysterious secrets it holds. Explore every corner and crevice hand-drawn with vivid, gruesome detail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Haunting, Handcrafted World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.poster.avif?t=1761583747\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.webm?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.mp4?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a bizarre interior landscape of a colossal beast. Every dripping detail and splatter tells a story waiting to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revolutionary Combat &amp; Fusion Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/7bdc4c0930d98d54c890e35d51ec582f.poster.avif?t=1761583747\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/7bdc4c0930d98d54c890e35d51ec582f.webm?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic 2D metroidvania action with a twist. Use the different <strong>combinations</strong> to experiment and unlock new gruesome abilities and passages within the game world. Evolve in something new: better, faster and stronger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Thrilling Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.poster.avif?t=1761583747\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.webm?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.mp4?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a range of enemies, each with its own unique challenge. Learn their secrets, adapt your strategies, and devour them one by one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.poster.avif?t=1761583747\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.webm?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.mp4?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our intuitive level editor, transform your journey into a sandbox of creativity. Build your own metroidvania adventure and creatures using all the elements you've encountered in the main adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world that blends visceral atmosphere with inventive gameplay, where every step forward deepens the mystery of your very existence. Every encounter is an opportunity to evolve.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560430?t=1761583747","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560430?t=1761583747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/50db938164246ecef951bb99b426435749d41ffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761583747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/50db938164246ecef951bb99b426435749d41ffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761583747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3809560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Evolvania</i>\u00a0you embody a mysterious, wandering eye on a quest to seize  eyedrops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deep into a colossal creature and discover the mysterious secrets it holds. Explore every corner and crevice hand-drawn with vivid, gruesome detail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Haunting, Handcrafted World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.poster.avif?t=1761583747\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.webm?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.mp4?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a bizarre interior landscape of a colossal beast. Every dripping detail and splatter tells a story waiting to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revolutionary Combat &amp; Fusion Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/7bdc4c0930d98d54c890e35d51ec582f.poster.avif?t=1761583747\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/7bdc4c0930d98d54c890e35d51ec582f.webm?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic 2D metroidvania action with a twist. Use the different <strong>combinations</strong> to experiment and unlock new gruesome abilities and passages within the game world. Evolve in something new: better, faster and stronger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Thrilling Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.poster.avif?t=1761583747\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.webm?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/9e23eed2fa0dac219c23f93f9676cf3d.mp4?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a range of enemies, each with its own unique challenge. Learn their secrets, adapt your strategies, and devour them one by one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.poster.avif?t=1761583747\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.webm?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.mp4?t=1761583747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our intuitive level editor, transform your journey into a sandbox of creativity. Build your own metroidvania adventure and creatures using all the elements you've encountered in the main adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world that blends visceral atmosphere with inventive gameplay, where every step forward deepens the mystery of your very existence. Every encounter is an opportunity to evolve.</p>","developers":["IV Productions","Elan Manuguerra"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/459535a5c47f81dd61eb97e8655e7b61808d7d6b/header.jpg?t=1761583747","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3560430/857730952/c27e5c4d7f92aaf0a6255f6b67cfe6b4287b26f1/1761322345/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761323450","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3560430/857730952/c27e5c4d7f92aaf0a6255f6b67cfe6b4287b26f1/1761322345/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761323450","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3560430/857730952/c27e5c4d7f92aaf0a6255